  "decision_summary": "The query is carbamazepine, and the closest structural analogues—carbamazepine epoxide, oxcarbazepine, licarbazepine, and eslicarbazepine—show absolute oral bioavailability values of 60–99% in humans, with food not impairing absorption. This strongly supports F ≥ 20%.",
